ening Period (Visit 1).", "bboxes": [[72.00000000000011, 219.1439829101563, 428.7600000000001, 208.85497521784862]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 43, "section": "6.1 Trial Flowchart", "exactText": "The trial includes a Run-in Period (if stable conventional treatment needed), a 4-week Screening Period, a 12-week double-blind Treatment Period, and a 3-week Safety Follow-up Period to Day 105.", "bboxes": [[71.99999999999989, 689.9039829101564, 547.0799999999998, 588.5349752178487]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "exactText": "Visit 1: Screening Visit, start of Screening Period (Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2)... Visit 9: Safety Follow-up Visit, scheduled at 35 days after the last dose of IMP (Day 105).", "bboxes": [[90.0, 670.7999829101562, 502.92, 660.0549752178486], [72.0, 288.6239829101562, 551.5200000000001, 247.9749752178485]], "relevance": "medium"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": true, "condense_ms": 0.005708076059818268, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 845.3237088397145, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.4839, 0.4784, 0.4752, 0.4652, 0.461, 0.459, 0.4493, 0.4438, 0.4424, 0.4393, 0.4378, 0.4357, 0.4336, 0.4295, 0.4286, 0.428, 0.4267, 0.4232, 0.4222, 0.4196, 0.4185, 0.4095, 0.4077, 0.4041, 0.4015, 0.3998, 0.3946, 0.3931, 0.3923, 0.3881, 0.3859, 0.3855, 0.385, 0.3845, 0.3839, 0.3832, 0.3822, 0.3802, 0.3799, 0.3782, 0.3775, 0.3761, 0.3755, 0.3721, 0.3709], "confidence_filter_dropped_scores": [], "confidence_filter_bm25_only_scores_normalized": [], "hybrid_search": true, "cache_hit": true, "em