INFO     rag_service.services.generation_service:generation_service.py:427 {"event": "rag_query_trace", "query": "How many site visits are there and what are they?", "retrieval_query": null, "system_prompt_version": "440b2406", "retrieved_chunks": [{"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 73, "section": "11.1 Periodic Monitoring", "score": 0.005099818, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 26, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "score": 0.0030634168, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 52, "section": "6.4 Unscheduled Visits", "score": 0.0021239663, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "score": 0.0018895386, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 45, "section": "Table 1 Time and Events Schedule", "score": 0.0014269596, "scores": null, "had_context": true}, {"title": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 44, "section": "Table 1 Time and Events Schedule", "score": 0.0013831174, "scores": null, "had_context": true}], "context_char_count": 8323, "response": "Source: Protocol Ulcerative Colitis\n\nThe protocol describes 9\u201310 main investigational-site visits. The study flowchart specifically lists 9 scheduled visits; a Run-in/Stabilization visit may account for the potential 10th visit when stable conventional treatment is needed.\n[Section 3.1.2 Overall Design \u00b7 p.26]\n\nThe 9 scheduled visits are:\n1. Visit 1: Screening Visit (Days \u221228 to \u22121 before Visit 2).\n2. Visit 2: Randomisation Visit (Baseline), beginning the 12-week Treatment Period.\n3. Visit 3: Week 2.\n4. Visit 4: Week 4.\n5. Visit 5: Week 6.\n6. Visit 6: Week 8.\n7. Visit 7: Week 10.\n8. Visit 8: End-of-Treatment Visit (Week 12), completing the Treatment Period.\n9. Visit 9: Safety Follow-up Visit, 35 days after the last IMP dose (Day 105).\n[Section Study Flowchart \u00b7 p.9]\n\nIf a run-in is required, the schedule also includes Visit 0: Stabilization during the Run-in Period.\n[Section Table 1 Time and Events Schedule \u00b7 p.45]", "sources": [{"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 26, "section": "3.1.2 Overall Design", "exactText": "There will be 9 ~ 10 main visits at the investigational site during the study:", "bboxes": [[72.0, 603.5039829101565, 518.28, 593.2149752178489]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 9, "section": "Study Flowchart", "exactText": "- Visit 1: Screening Visit, start of Screening Period (Days -28 to -1 prior to Visit 2)\n- Visit 2: Randomisation Visit (Baseline), start of 12-week Treatment Period\n- Visits 3-7: 5 visits during 12-week Treatment Period\n- Visit 8: End of Treatment (EoT) Visit, completion of 12-week Treatment Period\n- Visit 9: Safety Follow-up Visit, scheduled at 35 days after the last dose of IMP (Day 105).", "bboxes": [[90.0, 670.7999829101562, 502.92, 660.0549752178486]], "relevance": "high"}, {"name": "Protocol Ulcerative Colitis", "page": 45, "section": "Table 1 Time and Events Schedule", "exactText": "Visits, Run-in = Visit 0 Stabilization.", "bboxes": [[75.06486511230469, 495.4773864746094, 810.2346801757812, 247.2222900390625]], "relevance": "medium"}], "timing": {"response_cache_hit": false, "semantic_cache_hit": false, "chunks_compressed": false, "condense_ms": 0.0007916241884231567, "query_condensed": false, "embedding_ms": 838.0437502637506, "embedding_cache_hit": false, "retrieval": {"chunk_cache_hit": false, "confidence_filter_applied": true, "confidence_filter_threshold": 0.04, "confidence_filter_bm25_threshold": null, "confidence_filter_input_count": 45, "confidence_filter_kept_count": 45, "confidence_filter_dropped_count": 0, "confidence_filter_kept_scores": [0.4348, 0.4045, 0.3849, 0.3497, 0.3467, 0.3433, 0.3427, 0.3334, 0.3295, 0.3282, 0.3156, 0.3035, 0.2932, 0.2899, 0.2895, 0.289, 0.288, 0.2874, 0.2868, 0.2